Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 20:38:56 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/9] Mac Settings: grouped forms; bold titles

Pages' forms as macOS's grouped panels: Kirigami's new forms in their
"cards" style (KDE_KIRIGAMI_FORMS_STYLE), and classic FormLayouts
decorated after load (qml/MacFormPanels.qml: a panel behind each run of
rows, left-aligned labels and section titles, no separator lines).
Classic pages' titles are bold too.

